<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='zh-TW'><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>IG SOP</title><style>body{font-family:Arial,'Microsoft JhengHei';background:#f5f7fb;margin:0}.c{max-width:900px;margin:40px auto;padding:20px}h1{text-align:center}.card{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}.s{display:inline-block;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:bold}ul{line-height:1.9}.flow{text-align:center;font-size:20px;line-height:2}.note{background:#fff8db;border-left:5px solid #f5b700;padding:15px;border-radius:8px}</style></head><body><div class='c'><h1>📩 Instagram 留言自動轉私訊 SOP</h1><div class='card'><span class='s'>STEP1</span><h2>前置準備</h2><ul><li>IG切換專業帳號</li><li>開啟允許存取訊息</li><li>連結Facebook粉專</li></ul></div><div class='card'><span class='s'>STEP2</span><h2>連接ManyChat</h2><ul><li>登入ManyChat</li><li>選Instagram</li><li>完成Meta授權</li></ul></div><div class='card'><span class='s'>STEP3</span><h2>建立Automation</h2><ul><li>Automation→New Automation</li><li>Comments觸發</li><li>選貼文/Reels</li></ul></div><div class='card'><span class='s'>STEP4</span><h2>留言關鍵字</h2><ul><li>優惠</li><li>連結</li><li>想要</li><li>+1</li></ul></div><div class='card'><span class='s'>STEP5</span><h2>設定DM</h2><ul><li>第一則：感謝留言</li><li>第二則：商品連結</li><li>加入按鈕</li></ul></div><div class='card'><h2>流程</h2><div class='flow'>留言「優惠」<br>⬇<br>ManyChat偵測<br>⬇<br>公開回覆<br>⬇<br>自動私訊<br>⬇<br>商品頁</div></div><div class='note'><b>測試：</b>用另一個IG帳號留言「優惠」，確認收到私訊即可。</div></div></body></html>
